00:10:38.203 --> 00:10:40.472
you choose not to do so.
Yeah, John, please.

00:10:40.472 --> 00:10:43.042
-What is the crime exactly
that you're accusing him of?

00:10:43.042 --> 00:10:44.110
-You know what the crime is.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.011
The crime is very obvious
to everybody.

00:10:46.011 --> 00:10:48.847
All you have to do is read
the newspapers, except yours.

00:10:48.847 --> 00:10:52.651
-My God, man, at least do
some research before you lie.

00:10:52.651 --> 00:10:55.587
Do a Google search for federal
crimes and just pick one.

00:10:55.587 --> 00:10:57.723
"Mr. President,
what's Obamagate?"

00:10:57.723 --> 00:11:01.393
[ As Trump ] Well,
he illegally imported

00:11:01.393 --> 00:11:04.095
certain agricultural products

00:11:04.095 --> 00:11:06.699
without properly declaring them
after a trip abroad.

00:11:06.699 --> 00:11:07.867
That's bad.

00:11:07.867 --> 00:11:09.735
Class B misdemeanor
with a possible sentence.

00:11:09.735 --> 00:11:13.272
Hold on -- Four months in jail
and a $10,000 fine.

00:11:13.272 --> 00:11:14.940
So checkmate, libs.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.309
[ Normal voice ] Trump's insane
demand that Biden be prosecuted

00:11:17.309 --> 00:11:19.545
is based on a flimsy report
about Hunter Biden

00:11:19.545 --> 00:11:21.647
in "The New York Post" that even
"The Post"'s own reporters

00:11:21.647 --> 00:11:23.081
refused to put their names on.

00:11:23.081 --> 00:11:24.417
The whole thing
is the brainchild

00:11:24.417 --> 00:11:27.252
of Italian Wile E. Coyote
Rudy Giuliani,

00:11:27.252 --> 00:11:29.021
the same guy
who we found out yesterday

00:11:29.021 --> 00:11:30.622
got duped by Borat.

00:11:30.622 --> 00:11:32.991
-President Trump's personal
lawyer, Rudy Giuliani,

00:11:32.991 --> 00:11:36.061
is denying he did anything wrong
in the new Borat movie.

00:11:36.061 --> 00:11:38.830
His denial comes after word
of a compromising

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:42.501
and edited scene in the movie in
which Giuliani talks to a young,

00:11:42.501 --> 00:11:44.703
fake female reporter
in a bedroom.

00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:46.872
Giuliani says
he was adjusting his clothes

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:48.673
after taking off a microphone.

00:11:48.673 --> 00:11:51.110
-I will say if Rudy
hadn't been tricked

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.012
by a Sacha Baron Cohen
character,

00:11:53.012 --> 00:11:56.515
I would have assumed he was
a Sacha Baron Cohen character.

00:11:56.515 --> 00:11:58.817
I mean, he looks like a guy
who either wears no makeup

00:11:58.817 --> 00:12:00.986
or seven hours of makeup.

00:12:00.986 --> 00:12:03.488
I mean, that's either
a weird old dude

00:12:03.488 --> 00:12:06.591
or a teenager working real hard
to buy beer.

00:12:06.591 --> 00:12:09.094
Of course, this isn't the best
prank ever pulled on Rudy.

00:12:09.094 --> 00:12:11.096
The best prank is definitely
still the time

00:12:11.096 --> 00:12:13.866
he looked at his wife and said,
"You're my cousin?!"

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:17.302
[ Laughter ]

00:12:17.302 --> 00:12:20.138
Now, Rudy claims he was just
tucking in his shirt.

00:12:20.138 --> 00:12:22.441
And honestly, who knows?
Maybe he was.

00:12:22.441 --> 00:12:25.077
He's one of those weird old guys
who does stuff like

00:12:25.077 --> 00:12:26.812
lie in on a bed
to tuck a shirt in

00:12:26.812 --> 00:12:28.948
or keep half a tuna salad
sandwich

00:12:28.948 --> 00:12:30.716
