00:12:30.716 --> 00:12:33.418
I'm sure his super has had to
come up to his apartment

00:12:33.418 --> 00:12:35.854
to pull cigar butts
out of his shower drain.

00:12:35.854 --> 00:12:38.089
So that's the guy.
That's the guy right there,

00:12:38.089 --> 00:12:40.359
