00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:22.868
but Donald Trump
will still be there.

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:25.337
You could be the best ballroom
dancer in the world,

00:13:25.337 --> 00:13:27.272
but if your partner is a moose
on roller skates,

00:13:27.272 --> 00:13:28.606
