00:13:41.153 --> 00:13:43.088
"Mr. President, this question is
for you."

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:45.624
[ As Trump ] Quiet, quiet!
I thought I saw a $20 in there!

00:13:45.624 --> 00:13:47.058
[ Normal voice ] I'm also
willing to predict Trump

00:13:47.058 --> 00:13:48.894
